Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Introduction", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9860455581723976`*^9, 3.9860455606945095`*^9}},
 CellTags->{"SectionHeader", "TemplateContent"},
 CellID->718375759,ExpressionUUID->"c7976246-8c66-1a47-8c8b-5b27ca30218b"],

Cell["\<\
Malaria is one of the global health crisis accounting for approximately 78% \
of all deaths occurring in  children under the age of five especially in the \
sub-Saharan Africa. The African region records over 95% of global malaria \
deaths with children under 5 being the most vulnerable and often suffering \
from severe malaria cases. High burden countries overall: Nigeria, Democratic \
Republic of the Congo, Burkina Faso, Ivory Coast, Uganda, Mali, Mozambique, \
Angola, Cameroon, Niger. 

The aim of this computational essay is to calculate the time series analysis \
of child mortality due to malaria using the data repository dataset \"Child \
Mortality from Malaria\". This essay is fundamentally based on answering the \
following research questions:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.986045567321596*^9, 3.986045588921829*^9}, {
  3.9860456485775146`*^9, 3.98604570818849*^9}, {3.9860457431495247`*^9, 
  3.9860457642813816`*^9}, {3.986046963461132*^9, 3.9860470203247566`*^9}, {
  3.986047115745268*^9, 3.9860472713289223`*^9}, {3.9860473029994793`*^9, 
  3.9860473308339767`*^9}, {3.986047390218956*^9, 3.986047493852783*^9}, {
  3.9860475296672363`*^9, 3.986047594072691*^9}, {3.986048058453665*^9, 
  3.9860480650663605`*^9}, {3.9860549467456856`*^9, 3.9860550195336533`*^9}},
 CellTags->{"ExampleTopicSentence", "TemplateContent"},
 CellID->943489062,ExpressionUUID->"119919f4-2c5e-ae48-b8d9-d6601fdae151"],

Cell["\<\
How has the global child mortality due to  malaria changed over the period of \
2000 to 2015?\
\>", "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9860457554655895`*^9, 3.9860457756843967`*^9}, {
  3.986103009919138*^9, 3.9861030113905563`*^9}},
 CellTags->"TemplateContent",
 CellID->256645759,ExpressionUUID->"0e7e535e-6704-f948-bfbd-5fbc79b530d8"],

Cell["Which countries have the highest mortality rates?", "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.986045780952057*^9, 3.986045790884384*^9}},
 CellID->75213812,ExpressionUUID->"45e8c4df-621b-d943-bb25-2eaffbcb740a"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Data Loading and Cleaning", "Section",
