Cell["\<\
The bar chart shows the highest burden countries and all located in \
sub-Saharan African region.\[LineSeparator]Nigeria recorded over 2.4 million \
child deaths from malaria across 16 years window which is nearly five times \
higher than the next highest country in the chart.
\
\>", "CodeText",
